One detail bites people.

33
00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:12.640
The conventions define gen_ai.

34
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:13.773
usage.

35
00:01:14.053 --> 00:01:20.325
input_tokens to include cached tokens, and record cache reads and writes in separate attributes as well.

36
00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:21.864
Claude’s own usage.

37
00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:24.747
input_tokens counts only uncached input.

38
00:01:25.027 --> 00:01:32.515
If you copy the provider’s field straight into the convention’s attribute, every cache hit makes your input counts look smaller than they are.

39
00:01:32.795 --> 00:01:34.949
Status, verified for this lesson.

40
00:01:35.229 --> 00:01:43.165
The GenAI conventions are marked Development, OpenTelemetry’s label for conventions that may still change in breaking ways.

41
